{"path":"container/array/at","title":"std::array<T,N>::at","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::array&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>at","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/array/at","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reference to the element at specified location pos, with bounds checking.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">reference at<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(constexpr since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reference at<span class=\"br0\">(</span> size_type pos <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reference to the element at specified location <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code>, with bounds checking.\n</p><p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pos</span></code> is not within the range of the container, an exception of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/out_of_range\">std::out_of_range</a></span> is thrown.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pos\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> position of the element to return\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the requested element\n</